                    {
                        "sense_id": "35c31f58-0357-32fc-bdb1-297b219d3795",
                        "entry_id": "a90a773f-7b74-387a-b1c3-7a0921d718a5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het leggen van de hand op iemands hoofd om een spiritueel of paranormaal effect te bewerkstelligen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4382e678-58a5-4e9b-9f51-95dbe7f127a0",
                                "sense_id": "35c31f58-0357-32fc-bdb1-297b219d3795",
                                "text": "Kuyt praat met gehandicapte kinderen op een bijeenkomst van de Dirk Kuyt Foundation. Kuyt ondergaat een handoplegging van een magnetiseur. Kuyt huilt als hij over zijn overleden vader praat – altijd weer stuitend hoe makkelijk tv-makers naar tranen op zoek gaan."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea25d955-f13c-47a2-8299-d810379ffb3a",
                                "sense_id": "35c31f58-0357-32fc-bdb1-297b219d3795",
                                "text": "De korte film draait onder anderen om de 22-jarige Daniel, een vlogger die zijn studie en baan opgaf voor God. Nu probeert hij, zingend, pratend in tongen en evangeliserend in de stad, mensen door handoplegging te genezen: \"Toen God mijn ziel aanraakte, veranderde mijn leven.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0ea89529-6fb5-4d0b-b124-d040275f2783",
                        "source_entry_id": "a90a773f-7b74-387a-b1c3-7a0921d718a5",
                        "source_sense_id": "35c31f58-0357-32fc-bdb1-297b219d3795",
                        "source_sense_description": "het leggen van de hand op iemands hoofd",
                        "target_lang_word": "laying on of hands",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "laying on of hands",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "889b5dd8-1ba3-3dae-af32-5cbeeed640bb",
                                        "entry_id": "872e8abd-ad37-33ea-8fdb-1b857f21ac44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The practice of using touch to communicate spiritual energy from one person to another, especially as an act of healing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa1162c4-4ed2-43a3-abc3-b074acd8dcdb",
                                                "sense_id": "889b5dd8-1ba3-3dae-af32-5cbeeed640bb",
                                                "text": "And when Simon ſaw that through laying on of the Apoſtles hands', the holy Ghoſt was giuen, hee offered them money,[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7de37f4-1f6d-4780-b474-00fa1b175681",
                                                "sense_id": "889b5dd8-1ba3-3dae-af32-5cbeeed640bb",
                                                "text": "He holds daily levees, which are crowded, at Metropolitan Hall, where he proclaims that he has been sent of God to heal diseases by the touch. Many are fools enough to try the experiment . . . . His formula is, \"Disease, depart,\" accompanied with a laying on of hands."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc2d33b5-70cc-475d-9013-c9a68673cd01",
                                                "sense_id": "889b5dd8-1ba3-3dae-af32-5cbeeed640bb",
                                                "text": "They cast out devils by magic charms, cured diseases by the laying on of hands, drank deadly poisons unharmed, and unharmed played with deadly snakes—or so they claimed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e66726c0-1a6d-4e8b-ac13-688f3b4a8dd3",
                                                "sense_id": "889b5dd8-1ba3-3dae-af32-5cbeeed640bb",
                                                "text": "This monstrous parody of divine compassion . . . performs, in the presence of moving picture cameras, a grotesque parody upon the laying on of hands and the healing of the sick."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a158f9e-f6b9-455e-a9c0-fd9f2838c42d",
                                                "sense_id": "889b5dd8-1ba3-3dae-af32-5cbeeed640bb",
                                                "text": "Popoff would race around an auditorium, striding up to dozens of people he had never met, greeting them by name, reciting their addresses, diagnosing their illnesses and then pretending to heal them with a laying on of hands."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f43840f9-a11b-3e93-8f1d-e45b735449e8",
                                        "entry_id": "872e8abd-ad37-33ea-8fdb-1b857f21ac44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The charism whereby new bishops are initiated into the apostolic succession."
                                        ],
